  "idea": "Implement exp(-i theta n^2) for theta = pi/2 + k*pi + delta using only the mode's co-located qubit as a dirty catalyst (arbitrary state, no ancilla). Uses n^2 mod 4 = n mod 2 so that exp(-i(pi/2)n^2) = R(pi/2) (-iZ)^n (-iY)^n (-iX)^n exactly; each (-iP)^n is CR(pi) conjugated by the Clifford taking Z to P (H for X, SH for Y). The product of the three P-conditioned pi rotations is a pure phase on the qubit for every Fock level, so the dirty qubit returns unchanged and no ancilla or SWAP routing is needed. Residual k*pi and small delta fold into a mode-only R rotation (3*delta from the n<=3 angle-matching expansion).",
